          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"NET0010\") ... (ref \"U1\") (pin \"7\") ... (ref \"U3\") (pin \"5\") (pinfunction \"LAN_PORT1_TX+\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"NET0004\") ... (ref \"U1\") (pin \"9\") ... (ref \"U3\") (pin \"6\") (pinfunction \"LAN_PORT1_TX-\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "J5 | RJ45 Amphenol RJMG1BD3B8K1ANR | Ethernet jack"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "the RJ45 jack J5's data pads ... all appear in the netlist as individually unconnected"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The RJ45 connector cannot carry Ethernet data, so wired Ethernet through the fitted jack will not work. The specification notes this connectivity as an open item, but the netlist confirms the functional disconnection in this build.",
      "confidence": 0.79
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The RJ45 data contacts are unconnected, while the SKW92A LAN1 pins are on separate nets. This leaves the fitted Ethernet jack nonfunctional; the specification also records the disconnection but leaves its intended status unresolved."
}

